        "text_Mwr94q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Collagen is the most abundant protein in your body and a critical building block for skin, hair, nails, and joints. It provides strength, structure, and elasticity, keeping your body’s tissues resilient and youthful. However, as we age, collagen production naturally declines, leading to visible signs of ageing. Let’s dive into why collagen matters and how you can restore it to look and feel your best. </p>",
            "size": 100,
            "text_position": "left",
            "spacing_bottom": 12
          }
        }
